card.statement:
The generators of $U_\A(\gh)$ satisfy the following relations.

[itemsep=3mm]

- $q^{\pm c} \text{ is central},\quad K_iK_j=K_jK_i,\quad K_ix^\pm_j(z)K_i^{-1}=q^{\pm A_{i,j}}X^\pm_j(z)$;

- $q^d X^\pm_{i,r} q^{-d}= q^r X^\pm_{i,r}  $;

- $\qK{K_{j}}{k}{n}X^\pm_{i,r}=X^\pm_{i,r}\qK{K_{j}}{k\pm A^\s_{i,j}}{n}$;

- $\qK{q^d}{k}{n}X^\pm_{i,r}=X^\pm_{i,r}\qK{q^d}{k+r}{n}$;

- $\qK{q^d}{k}{n}H^\pm_{i,r}=H^\pm_{i,r}\qK{q^d}{k+r}{n}$;

- $[H_{i,k},H_{j,l}]=\delta_{k-l,0}\,\dfrac{[kA_{i,j}]}{k}\qK{q^c}{k}{1}$;

- $[X^+_{i,r},X^-_{j,s}]=\delta_{i,j}\qK{K_{i}}{r,s}{1}$.

- $[H_{i,r},X^{\pm}_j(z)]=\pm\frac{[rA_{i,j}]}{r}q^{-c(r\pm|r|)/2}z^rX^\pm_j(z),$
